# Salon Icons

- The salon card icon is `assets/icon/logo.png`.
- Do not replace salon icons with `assets/branding/baylen-circular-logo.png` or gallery promotional images unless the user explicitly asks.
- Home salon cards in `lib/widgets/home/nearby_salons.dart` must keep the existing circular icon layout and use `assets/icon/logo.png`.
- Fallback salon data in `lib/screens/home_screen.dart` must use `assets/icon/logo.png`.
- Active `Outlets.image_url` rows in Catalyst should remain mapped to `assets/icon/logo.png` for salon listing icons.
